<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-027" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-027-wangshi-zan" source-id="s-nanqishu-027-wangshi-zan-ws1508012">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-027-wangshi-zan:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangshi-zan:p001:m0000" ref="85g_yq3_0w6_AA">玄載</persName>兄弟門從，世秉誠烈，不為道家所忌，斯今之耿氏也。</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-027-wangshi-zan:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">王為清政，其風不衰。<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangshi-zan:p002:m0010" ref="hgq_k4y_crp">玄邈</persName>簡<rs id="c-nanqishu-027-wangshi-zan:p002:m0013" type="unresolved">朕</rs>，早背同歸。</p>
</text>
